    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide</label><div><h5>Overview</h5><ul><li>Start page wif serch, favrits, to-do, notz, wezur, nuuz.</li><li>All local: dataz stays in ur browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favrits (when not typing)</li><li>/ : focus serch (also via palette)</li><li>Enter in serch: start serch</li><li>ESC: close modals</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widjits, theme, bakground, dataz, favrits</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets serch & clock</li></ul><h5>Serch & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Bangs: !g !ddg !bing !yt !wiki !maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settnz; {q} as placeholder</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent serchez, wordlist (global + presetz)</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts serch</li></ul><h5>Tiles</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favrit</li><li>Reset: restore defalt favrits</li></ul><h5>Widjits & Layout</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widjit</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Custom colors for clock/serch; reset restores style defaults</li><li>Widjit colors & \"Tint widjits\" set teh accent per card</li></ul><h5>Bakground</h5><ul><li>Presetz, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>Accent color is extracted from teh active bakground</li></ul><h5>Dataz</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON</li><li>Load dataz presetz (assets/presetz/*.json in teh repo)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
      "agentLabel": "Startpage Agent",
      "agentEnabled": "Agent enabled",
      "agentHint": "If disabled, nothing is sent to Ollama."
    }
